<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="e1411468">&lt;p&gt;
    Discuss the goals, objectives, opportunities/problems, and other strategic information with the project sponsor. Verify
    the currency and validity of the business goals, objectives, critical success factors, opportunities, and problems that
    the project is expected to address. Business goals, objectives, critical success factors, opportunities, and problems
    are part of the business strategy information of the enterprise. Review this information carefully. If the enterprise
    strategy has not been documented or is not available, you will need to identify the basic strategic direction of the
    project with the sponsor.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
